      "note": [
        "As of the second half of 2014, owners in the shareholder statistics are classified according to INSEKT 2014.",
        "In the autumn of 2006 the A-list and O-list on the Stockholm Stock Exchange where replaced by the lists Large cap, Mid cap and Small cap. The statistics on these lists covers the Stockholm market. From 200612 to 200806 shares on the Göteborg list is presented together with shares on the NGM Nordic MTF because shares quoted on the Göteborg list also is traded on NGM Nordic MTF.",
        "Aktietorget ceased to be an authorised marketplace in March 2007 and is from the publication of June 2007 figures included under other marketplaces.",
        "Shares on the Göteborgslista are from December 2008 reported on the list where they are also traded.",
        "The considerable drop of household s share wealth during the first half of 2011 is largely due to transfers of share holdings from the household sector to the non-financial corporation sector."
